"view.prenatal.help"                         = "Choose which moments that can occur in the prenatal period you want to display.\n\nBy default, Enigma selects 'Mutual aspects' and 'Eclipses', but you can also select ingresses and changes between retrograde and direct.\n\nYou can also modify the factors. The Moon is not included in the default selection, but you can adjust this. The same applies to aspects — by default Enigma only uses the conjunction, but this is easy to change.\n\nBear in mind that if you add the Moon and/or multiple aspects, you will get a very large number of results.\n\nClick 'Calculate' to view the results.";
